-0001-6860-6699"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8672-2845"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-3193-7969"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-3613-2270"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-4242-7526"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6257-4806"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-6969-4261"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7566-3138"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-7801-5777"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-0133-1613"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-1723-5087"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-2434-4206"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-4737-0968"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "1", "volume": "10", "journalIssueId": 3082699, "dateOfPublication": "2021 Jan", "monthOfPublication": 1, "yearOfPublication": 2021, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Syst Rev", "title": "Systematic reviews", "essn": "2046-4053", "issn": "2046-4053", "isoabbreviation": "Syst Rev", "nlmid": "101580575"}, "printPublicationDate": "2021-01-01"}, "pubYear": "2021", "pageInfo": "39", "abstractText": "<h4>Background</h4>Literature searches underlie the foundations of systematic reviews and related review types. Yet, the literature searching component of systematic reviews and related review types is often poorly reported. Guidance for literature search reporting has been diverse, and, in many cases, does not offer enough detail to authors who need more specific information about reporting search methods and information sources in a clear, reproducible way. This document presents the PRISMA-S (Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic reviews and Meta-Analyses literature search extension) checklist, and explanation and elaboration.<h4>Methods</h4>The checklist was developed using a 3-stage Delphi survey process, followed by a consensus conference and public review process.<h4>Results</h4>The final checklist includes 16 reporting items, each of which is detailed with exemplar reporting and rationale.<h4>Conclusions</h4>The intent of PRISMA-S is to complement the PRISMA Statement and its extensions by providing a checklist that could be used by interdisciplinary authors, editors, and peer reviewers to verify that each component of a search is completely reported and therefore reproducible.", "affiliation": "Health Science Center Libraries, George A. Smathers Libraries, University of Florida, Gainesville, USA. mlrethlefsen@gmail.com.", "publicationStatus": "epublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["research-article", "Journal Article", "Research Support, N.I.H., Extramural"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "Cancer Research UK", "acronym": "CRUK_", "grantId": "27294", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Cancer Research UK", "acronym": "CRUK_", "grantId": "C49297/A27294", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "NCATS NIH HHS", "acronym": "TR", "grantId": "UL1 TR002538", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "National Center for Advancing Translational Sciences", "grantId": "UL1TR002538", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Medical Research Council", "acronym": "MRC_", "grantId": "MR/J00488X/1", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Australian Research Council", "grantId": "DE200101618", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Cancer Research UK", "acronym": "CRUK_", "grantId": "16895", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Consensus"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Publications"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Checklist"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "descriptorName": "Research Report"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Systematic Reviews as Topic"}]}, "keywordList": {"keyword": ["Reproducibility", "Information Retrieval", "Systematic Reviews", "Literature Search", "Search Strategies", "Reporting Guidelines"]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Subscription required",